      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- VinMec\n- 3 weeks:\n    - Prototype:\n        - Front End: \n            - Phone App\n            - Fixed conversation flow\n            - Confirm destination\n            - Navigation: Communicate with backend to navigate user correctly\n            \n        - Backend: \n            - Available Map\n            - Figure out destination\n            - Navigation: \n                - Send next instruction upon user's request\n                - Validate if user reaches destination\n\nNote:\n    - What happen if internet is down?\n\n- Map Building",
      "fontSize": 26.999613069940576,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- VinMec\n- 3 weeks:\n    - Prototype:\n        - Front End: \n            - Phone App\n            - Fixed conversation flow\n            - Confirm destination\n            - Navigation: Communicate with backend to navigate user correctly\n            \n        - Backend: \n            - Available Map\n            - Figure out destination\n            - Navigation: \n                - Send next instruction upon user's request\n                - Validate if user reaches destination\n\nNote:\n    - What happen if internet is down?\n\n- Map Building",
